[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.1[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Choose Vista rest animation under Locomotion > Rest, using the full Idle Animation library while sitting at a vista.
[*]Keep your normal idle and vista pose separate, with per-outfit selections saved in profiles. Default restores the game's sitting pose.
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Improve shoulder-carried weapon support on Eve Peony and Black Pearl, Commander White, and both Unholy Genessa skins, with a relaxed thumb/index hold.
[*]Preserve Commander White's body motion while shoulder support is active.
[/list]

[b]CSS Shared Assets[/b]
Shoulder-support assets are included in CSS Shared Assets. No separate hand-support download is needed. Commander White v0.1.1 retains shared animation and facial-playback support. Existing Eve, Unholy Genessa and Commander White v0.1.0 packages remain compatible.

Vista poses use the same supported bodies and skeletons as Idle Animation in CSS Shared Assets. Sit/stand transitions stay under the game's control. Each clip keeps its authored position, so standing and dancing animations fit the stone differently from seated poses.

[b]Vista rest animation[/b]
[img]VISTA_REST_MENU_IMAGE_URL[/img]
[img]VISTA_REST_INGAME_IMAGE_URL[/img]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game and update both CSS and CSS Shared Assets to v1.0.1.
[*]Keep your CustomShellSystem/state folder and saved profiles.
[*]Replace the CSS_SharedAssets_P folder under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/.
[*]If you installed the private shoulder test, remove CSS_HandSupport_P from that folder.
[*]Restart the game after updating.
[/list]
